Description: Implements a suite of sensitivity analysis tools
  for Debiased Machine Learning as discussed in Chernozhukov, V., Cinelli, C., Newey, W., Sharma A., and Syrgkanis, V. (2026).
  "Long Story Short: Omitted Variable Bias in Causal Machine Learning." Review of Economics and Statistics. <doi:10.1162/REST.a.1705>.
